          "href": null,
          "images": [
            "/assets/building-interiors/ksvl-sticker-banner.jpg"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\n            \n            Women have been shaping computing since the 1800s. Meet the MAiVENS and TRAiLBLAZERS behind the ideas that helped make today’s AI possible.Meet them at the LUMINAiRY\n          ",
